messages[40]{user,text}:
  user_2,"Hello, may I speak with Akanksha Bhatt please? ... [14:10:05]"
  user_1,"Speaking... hi, this is Akanksha."
  user_2,"Hi Akanksha, this is Anita Sharma from Trust Wealth Advisors at DCoders. How are you today? [14:10:12]"
  user_1,"I'm good, thank you. Just a bit busy, but okay. [14:10:18]"
  user_2,"Great! I’m calling regarding your health policy renewal. I see the previous policy expired on 31/03/2026. We have a one‑year renewal offer at a discounted premium of ₹11,875, covering 01/04/2026 to 31/03/2027. Does that sound okay? [14:10:30]"
  user_1,"Yes, I remember the email. I just wanted to double‑check a few things before I pay."
  user_2,"Sure, happy to help. What would you like to clarify?"
  user_1,"[typing] ... what happens if I cancel after paying?"
  user_2,"If you cancel within 15 days of activation, there’s a cancellation fee of 10% of the premium, and the policy will be terminated retroactively. After 15 days, it’s non‑cancelable for the year. [14:11:05]"
  user_1,"Got it. And the payment methods?"
  user_2,"You can pay via net‑banking, UPI, or credit card. We’ll send you a secure payment link by email right after this call."
  user_1,"Okay. Also, can I get a copy of the renewed policy document now?"
  user_2,"I’ve already emailed you the renewal document in step 3. Let me know if you need me to resend."
  user_1,"I saw it, thanks. Just wanted to confirm the coverage includes day‑care procedures?"
  user_2,"Yes, the plan covers day‑care surgeries, pre‑and post‑hospitalisation, and outpatient consultations up to ₹2 lakh per annum."
  user_1,"Sounds good. One more thing—any additional discount if I pay the full amount now?"
  user_2,"The ₹11,875 is already the discounted rate. No further discount applies."
  user_1,"Alright. I’ll make the payment now."
  user_2,"Perfect. I’ll send the payment link right away. Please hold for a moment while I trigger it."
  user_2,"[hold music] ... (soft instrumental) ... [14:12:30]"
  user_2,"Okay, the link has been sent to your email: akanksha.bhatt@example.com. It’s a secure URL that expires in 24 hours."
  user_1,"Thanks. Let me open it."
  user_1,"[typing] ... [dog barks in background] ..."
  user_1,"I’m seeing the page, but it asks for my policy number. It’s SH‑2026‑0456, right?"
  user_2,"Correct, policy number SH‑2026‑0456."
  user_1,"Alright, I’ll pay via UPI. What’s the UPI ID?"
  user_2,"Our UPI ID is dcoders@upi. Please enter the amount ₹11,875 and mention your policy number in the note."
  user_1,"Okay, sending now... [typing]"
  user_1,"[phone line crackles] ... Done! I got a confirmation SMS."
  user_2,"Great! Let me check the activation on my end."
  user_2,"[typing]..."
  user_2,"I see the payment is reflected. Your policy is now active as of 01/04/2026. You’ll receive an activation email shortly."
  user_1,"Perfect. Could you also resend the policy document in PDF?"
  user_2,"Sure, I’m attaching it again. Expect it in a few seconds."
  user_2,"[hold music] ... (brief pause) ..."
  user_2,"Email sent. Let me know if you need anything else."
  user_1,"That’s all, thank you so much, Anita."
  user_2,"You’re welcome, Akanksha. Have a great day! Bye."
  user_1,"Bye."